BT /F1 11 Tf 60 760 Td 15 TL
(Applications) '
() '
(Dorigo's Ant System applied these ideas to the travelling salesman problem. Artificial) '
(ants build tours probabilistically, biased by pheromone and distance; good tours deposit) '
(more pheromone. Variants are used for vehicle routing, network packet routing and job-) '
(shop scheduling.) '
() '
(Comparison with other collective decision systems) '
() '
(Like honeybee nest-site selection, ant foraging is decentralized: no individual has) '
(global knowledge, yet the group converges on good solutions through local signals,) '
(recruitment and thresholds. The balance between exploitation \(follow strong trails\) and) '
(exploration \(random wandering\) mirrors many learning algorithms.) '
() '
ET
endstream
endobj
